        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F60PAR, Ornate Parthenon Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOrnately decorated, Schlage's Parthenon Single Cylinder Handleset is a beautiful example of the exquisite style one might find on the elegant homes of the Hamptons. It is made to install easily, with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. It will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick door. The antique brass finish only brings out the old world beauty of this handleset. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/parthenon-dummy-handleset-schlage-f93par\"><b>Parthenon Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Parthenon Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Parthenon Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Antique Brass\r\n<li>Overall Outside Handle Length: 12-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 2-1/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Length: 3-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 2-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 3-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center deadbolt to latch spacing</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The handleset is only available in Antique Brass (609) finish and the inside trim will match the outside handle.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This Item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/handlesets\">Door Handles</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Parthenon Single Cylinder Handleset, Schlage F60PAR",
                "description": "Parthenon Single Cylinder Handleset F60PAR - Ornately decorated, Schlage's Parthenon Single Cylinder Handleset is a beautiful example of the exquisite style one might find on the elegant homes of the Hamptons. It is made to install easily, with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit 1-5/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch thick door. The antique brass finish only brings out the old world beauty of this handleset. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.\r\n</p>",
                "keywords": "SCH-f60PAR, Schlage Parthenon handlesets, schlage f60PAR, schlage single cylinder handlesets, grade 1 handlesets, ornate handlesets, traditional front door handlesets, traditional handlesets, schlage f series single cylinder handlesets,"
